  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The angle subtended by two consecutive marks at the center <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Hence, at &ldquo;half past <math><mn>3</mn></math> &rdquo; the angle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>",
